    "reviews": "\u201cNot only did it offer some excellent Myst-inspired environmental puzzling, but it also weaved a complex sci-fi storyline that was actually quite engaging...\u201d<br>TouchArcade<br><br>\u201cThe brain stimulation of the puzzle, combined with the exploration of fascinating environments and the mystery of a story that is only hinted at and waiting to be discovered, are confirmed as perfect ingredients for the construction of an engaging adventure.\u201d<br>80/100 \u2013 Multiplayer it<br>",
